# Cypress artifacts
# Keep final HTML report but ignore generated JSON and screenshots under reports
cypress/screenshots/
cypress/videos/

# per-spec wrapper JSON created by our in-repo reporter (transient)
cypress/reports/cucumber/*.json
# transformed cucumber json inputs for the external reporter
cypress/reports/cucumber/json/
cypress/reports/cucumber/json-for-reporter/
cypress/reports/cucumber/screenshots/

## Reporting artifacts
# Ignore generated HTML report and debug output directories (transient)
cypress/reports/cucumber/html/
cypress/reports/cucumber/debug/
